# Security

## Data ownership
- Every user-scoped Prisma query: `where: { id, userId }` (or scoped via relation)

## Auth in actions and pages
- `getRequiredUserId()` / `requireUser()` / `requireAdmin()` from `@/lib/session`

## Auth in API routes
- `auth()` from `@/lib/auth` only — never `requireUser()` (redirect breaks JSON)

## PDF exception
- `generateInvoicePDF(id, true)` only after HMAC/token verification in `app/api/invoice/[invoiceId]/route.ts`

## Secrets
- No `process.env` outside `lib/env.ts`

## Admin safety
- Admin deletes/mutations: `isAdmin: false` in `where` when affecting users; `requireAdmin()` on all `app/admin` surfaces

## Cron
- `POST /api/cron/recurring-invoices` — Bearer `CRON_SECRET` only

## Email limits
- Count/limit via `getUserUsage` / `isEmailLimitOk` — never raw `EmailLog` counts in actions
